{"title":"2009 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Emily sets up a lemonade stand. She has set-up costs of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/3/59309bdf3e8c0ecbdbe60888412cbbf38bd3e6b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> and each cup of lemonade costs her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/d/90dfbdbe7579b90dd9628d52d693f145426a423e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> to make. She sells each cup of lemonade for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a52990ff1664f1102b7b1fac4e7b2106f5e0728.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the total cost, including the set-up, for her to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> cups of lemonade?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each cup of lemonade costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/d/90dfbdbe7579b90dd9628d52d693f145426a423e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> to make, so it costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7cfd14552b51aeb4a16c1155667ce989fb805bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.15 \\times 100 = \\$15.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"158\" height=\"17\" /> for her to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> cups of lemonade (excluding the set-up).\n</p><p>The set-up is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/3/59309bdf3e8c0ecbdbe60888412cbbf38bd3e6b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" />, so the total cost would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5a134e7d8af3302b77bff39df658fd5321e0f63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15.00 + 12.00 = \\boxed{\\$27.00}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"193\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017221551\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 315/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1626/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100